editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:106:5. **Learning encounters (+25,000).** Holding as a discipline ("the hold"): Lira running without the burst, Brom carrying without hardening, Karis keeping one point, Cael cataloguing his nine as held things with idle rents (+4k). Karis's discharge hypothesis tested (+1.5k). The shale-back study day (+2k). Oryn's field-care and two-readings teaching (+2.5k). The perimeter procedure and the six trials (+3k). The loft covenant (+1.5k). The listening cascade (+2k). The strata demonstration (+1.5k). The reading taught on the road (+1k). The wyrm trials (+2k). **New: Lira learns to shoot braced one-armed from Thornwater's bowman** during the week of tables (+4k). That plants Ch21, where "she could not span a bow one-armed… and could shoot one." *Why:* the formula's front-loaded teaching (§7), and so every winning mechanism is taught before it is used.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:129:**Physical challenge or learning encounter per movement:** M1 the wash recovery, the hold drilled, the Thornwater stretch walked at dusk · M2 the ford (developed fight), the well, Lira's first runs on a stiff ankle · M3 the fan haul, the bench, the stampede (terrain fight), the lip · M4 the perimeter walk and the six trials inside the line (a learning encounter for every one of the six) · M5 the Ring (central set piece), the deep reading · M6 **the deliberate quieter movement:** the bowman's one-armed shooting lessons, Cael relearning the Wind economy in Thornwater's yard under the listening, and the strata demonstration · M7 the run to the stair, the stalemate, the ascent and the rim · M8 the wyrm trials and the Hall, then the walk home into first snow.
