editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md:17:It is first light on the 306th, at the shale camp below the notch. Seln comes back wet to the ankle from the pass's floor. Twelve and a mule. Vastin is on day 27. The ribs have been quiet since the marsh, and the thirteenth is listening.
