editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:385:- The kit's ledger: "third site confirmed on bearing". The audio rule: "the Bronze from Ardenmere" in spoken inventories.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:480:**Names pending owner approval: none required.** Every new figure the expansion needs is carried by role: the axe-head hold's factor, the carter at the ice road, the ferryman and his boy, Oryn's route patients (at Oxhollow and unnamed holds), the hold child at the Kindling, the broker's men, and the hood in the tail. This keeps the audio load low in a book whose cast is already heavy with role-names (Teague's crew must stay unnamed by canon). If the author finds a recurring role that needs a name in the audio, it is listed here for approval before drafting, and drafted under the proposed name per the edition's policy (RUN-LEDGER 18:41).
